NOTICE — data provenance

The licence above covers the code in this repository. It makes no claim over the
underlying fight statistics, which are not this project's to license.

Those statistics originate from UFCStats.com and are read via the public
community mirror Greco1899/scrape_ufc_stats (GPL-3.0). This project does not
scrape, contact, or otherwise access UFC systems; the pipeline reads the mirror's
published CSVs only. What ships in receipts/data.json is derived — rolling and
recency-weighted averages, Elo, form, layoff and age features — rather than a
reproduction of the source tape.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the UFC, Zuffa LLC or TKO
Group. All fighter names and event names are the property of their respective
owners and appear here as statements of fact about publicly reported results.

If you are the rights holder and want something changed, open an issue.
